    "CoiStatement": "Dr. Bianchi reports grants from IGEA, during the conduction of the study. Dr. Campanacci reports grants from IGEA, during the conduction of the study. Dr. Donati reports grants from IGEA, during the conduction of the study. Dr. Ronchetti is a full-time employee of IGEA.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "3088-3094"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": [
        {
